    "description": "<p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">You can conduct a 10-minute Ritual to conjure a familiar that you control with your Action or by skipping your Move. The familiar can be any Small Being with HD: 1. It uses your Cast Skill for Checks, and you can Cast Spells from the familiar as if it were originating from you.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">The familiar is banished when it drops to 0 HP or if you conduct this Ritual again to create another familiar.</span></p>",
